    <h1>Electrician Lead Generation: More Qualified Calls and Estimates</h1>
    <p class="lf-lede">Electrician lead generation means attracting suitable local inquiries, identifying the electrical work a customer needs and moving qualified requests toward service or estimate appointments.</p>
